<title>UK: Barclays sets 20 bln yen 10-yr step-up FRN.</title>
<headline>Barclays sets 20 bln yen 10-yr step-up FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager BZW.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BARCLAYS PLC</p>
<p> AMT    20 BLN YEN    SPREAD  ** 10 BP     MATURITY  * 09.OCT.06</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 BASE	 3M LIBOR  PAY DATE  L-08.OCT.96</p>
<p> LAST MOODY AA3	 ISS PRICE  100.20    FULL FEES   0.40</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   AA-	 L-LONG FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> NOTES   ** TO 09.OCT.01, 60 BP THEREAFTER</p>
<p>	    * CALL AT PAR FROM 09.OCT.01</p>
<p> LISTING    LONDON    DENOMS (M) 1-100     SALE LIMITS US/UK/JP</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  UK	  TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.20	SELL CONC  0.20	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> RANK	 SUBORDINATED</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
